     \Gamma_d(a) = \pi^{d(d-1)/4}\prod_{i=1}^d\Gamma(a-(i-1)/2)

  and :math:`\Gamma(x)` is the :func:`~jax.scipy.special.gamma` function.

  Args:
    a: arraylike, real-valued.
